From 4648d3d9aaa50c3fd1e2c54a8f8fa7ae21fbf19d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 22:35:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Wire buyer portal to real Supabase data and the Buyer
 Discovery workflow
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces every buyer page's dummy-data.ts usage with live reads against
the buyers/buyer_requirements/client_reality_profiles/vendor_recommendations/
solution_models/roi_projections/solution_matches/gap_items/capability_frontier/
conversations/messages/meeting_requests/buyer_solution_decks tables (same
direct-REST pattern already used on the vendor side).

Replaces the scripted fake Discover chat with a real intake form that
triggers the buyer_requirement_submission Yoxa workflow — this guarantees
companyName is always present on save-buyer-requirements' first call,
fixing the 400 ("companyName or buyerId is required") that was cascading
into 404s on every downstream tool call.

Adds buyer-session/buyer-lookup/buyer-poll (mirroring the vendor-session/
vendor-lookup/vendor-poll pattern) to hand off buyer.id client-side once
discovery completes, and wires Requirements' "Add" and Handoff's "Confirm
meeting" to the real save-buyer-requirements / schedule-vendor-discussion
tools instead of local-only fake state.
